"animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_003_操夢_2.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.003.jpeg","id":"78D609E1-85F7-4D7E-B86F-C88C6659C892","slideTitle":"第3スライド"},{"voiceDuration":3.6365079365079365,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","telop":"「ちょうど、朝食ができて食べ始めたところだから、あんたも早く、席に着いてちゃちゃっと食べちゃいなさい。」","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"seStartTimeOffset":1.6999999999999993,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.004.jpeg","transitionName":"なし","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","bgmVolume":0.65,"showTelopOverlay":false,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"id":"92EE119D-3ECA-47E3-8040-962B9E0F8673","seVolume":0.8,"slideTitle":"第4スライド","seName":"SE: 決定・衝撃音","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/告知\/霊夢（微笑）.png","audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","duration":5.2,"title":"シーン 4","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_博麗霊夢.wav","animationName":"なし"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「分かった…」\n僕はそういうと、目の前の卵かけご飯を食べる。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/霧雨魔理沙_通常.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":19.90825396825397,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 5","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.005.jpeg","id":"9F551A60-AD7F-4CBA-AC78-02EE3DD83FDA","slideTitle":"第5スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","telop":"「そういえば、入学式は、親の付き添いっているの？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/告知\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":8.762607709750567,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 6","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_006_博麗霊夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.006.jpeg","id":"7C5EEEB3-7E8E-43E9-AA00-C533CAC40FBB","slideTitle":"第6スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「いや、大丈夫だから、付き添わなくていいよ。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/霧雨魔理沙_通常.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":19.771292517006803,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 7","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.007.jpeg","id":"A878B36E-6791-4ED8-98BA-3A028D18FDFA","slideTitle":"第7スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_reimu","telop":"「そう、じゃあ、あんたの分の食器は自分で洗いなさいね。\n私は、もう神社に向かうから。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/告知\/霊夢（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"博麗霊夢","voiceDuration":3.316984126984127,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 8","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_008_博麗霊夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.008.jpeg","id":"166D5EEF-D5F8-4C99-8D8D-86BFFFF86B86","slideTitle":"第8スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「分かった。」\n僕がそういうと、彼女はそのまま家を出ていった。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/霧雨魔理沙_通常.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":27.710430839002267,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 9","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_009_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.009.jpeg","id":"933293C5-F366-4362-A367-44446ED99B8C","slideTitle":"第9スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕は、それから数分も経たずに、朝食を食べ切ると、そのまあ流しに食器を入れ、ささっと洗剤で洗う。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":10.958253968253969,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 10","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_010_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.010.jpeg","id":"DE4DC7C7-EAD4-405E-BF86-EBDB5108DFDA","slideTitle":"第10スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そして、洗い物が終わると、自分の部屋に戻る。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":9.058253968253968,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 11","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_011_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.011.jpeg","id":"D8A7E766-A327-40D6-96DE-B2348E7CAF08","slideTitle":"第11スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そして、部屋に戻ると、新品の学校の制服を取り出し、ささっと着替える。そして、デスクをチラリと見ると、ある写真が写る。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":20.145215419501135,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 12","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.012.jpeg","id":"CC872B71-1B78-4BEC-96BC-94D60435B5AB","slideTitle":"第12スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"その写真には、巫女服の霊夢と、僕の父である妹紅、そして、僕の3人が写っていた。この時の僕はまだ、小学生だった。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.971292517006803,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 13","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.013.jpeg","id":"810D084D-62DA-4C6C-9433-277BB7B1D18B","slideTitle":"第13スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"今思えば、僕がこの学校を選んだ理由も、中学時代のある経験が原因だ。中学まで男子ばっかで度々トラブルになった。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":9.832154195011338,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 14","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.014.jpeg","id":"468E7017-37F6-4E8F-89C2-4E1A4CED99AD","slideTitle":"第14スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"世の中の男女比率…僕はそんなことを考えながら、ふと時計を見ると、もうすぐ家を出ないといけない時間で、頭を振る。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":14.060430839002267,"transitionName":"カラーでフェード","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 15","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_015_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.015.jpeg","id":"0AB23BBC-1BDC-42CF-8825-0946A185FC3E","slideTitle":"第15スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕は、学校に着くと、腕につけている時計を見る、\n思っていたよりも早く着いたみたいだった。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.258253968253968,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 16","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_016_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.016.jpeg","id":"DEB7EE3C-0350-464E-B838-CB085BADE5CD","slideTitle":"第16スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そして中に、入っていく。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.612607709750567,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 17","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_操夢_2.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.017.jpeg","id":"EC969664-CBA9-492A-A422-62A0238FCC6E","slideTitle":"第17スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕が教室に入ると、すでに教室にいた\n女子たちが一斉にコチラを見る。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":5.677823129251701,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 18","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_操夢_9.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.018.jpeg","id":"4C3EADAE-D6EE-41C8-9331-00FA42E0B914","slideTitle":"第18スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「あなたは…今年から来る中途入学の男子ですか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/さとり（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":2.7411791383219954,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 19","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.019.jpeg","id":"73EF0859-E993-4DA7-B501-B75534520493","slideTitle":"第19スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「中途入学…？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/さとり（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":92.51,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 20","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.020.jpeg","id":"53C7CBE6-AA0F-43D2-9623-250A8001376C","slideTitle":"第20スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「ええ、この学園では、幼稚部から大学院まであって、希望者は教員になって、定年まで居続けられる学園なんですよ。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/さとり（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":5.225646258503401,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 21","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_021_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.021.jpeg","id":"E2D00770-8013-4E87-9D5B-F46DC6C65EFF","slideTitle":"第21スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「へぇ…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/さとり（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.077823129251701,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 22","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_022_操夢_2.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.022.jpeg","id":"1F6A2A6F-736F-4452-99EE-5A6A50FB8E6F","slideTitle":"第22スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「その顔…もしかして、この学園のことを\n何も知らずに入学したんですか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":3.964784580498866,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 23","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.023.jpeg","id":"AE80167E-1642-47F3-A9B0-5A206917B40F","slideTitle":"第23スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「両親に、この学校に行けって言われて、\nただそのまま来たっていえばいいですか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":19.6234693877551,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 24","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.024.jpeg","id":"AB359FE5-6CF5-4C85-AFBA-2FB735BB2E07","slideTitle":"第24スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「そうですか…。まぁ、あなた以外はみな小さい頃から見知った同姓の学生ばかりですからね…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":6.512585034013606,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 25","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.025.jpeg","id":"05CFD358-3B0C-4CA4-9A43-C96CEE5D68E9","slideTitle":"第25スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「それで、僕の席は…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.80891156462585,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 26","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_026_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.026.jpeg","id":"6D279CCF-2516-4DA9-989E-FB12F1AEA160","slideTitle":"第26スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「確か、窓際の真ん中の席に空席があった気がしますが…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":3.2889795918367346,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 27","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_027_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.027.jpeg","id":"15A26839-BAED-4827-BAC9-5FBCB7DE15B5","slideTitle":"第27スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「そうですか…」\n僕は、そう呟くと言われた席につき、荷物をおろし始めた。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.835419501133787,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 28","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_028_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.028.jpeg","id":"7A987E93-1082-49D8-ADE8-743AF717E9E0","slideTitle":"第28スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"それからしばらくたち…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.029.jpeg","id":"FF9E3559-73B9-4126-853F-9FCE09970833","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"それから、数十分ほど経つと、チャイムがなり、教室が静まり返る。そして、数十秒程度の間の後、誰かが教室にはいってくる。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":13.064761904761905,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 30","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_030_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.030.jpeg","id":"3FB8775C-56A1-4D5C-B855-22715A9BCF8B","slideTitle":"第30スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「おはようございます。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":1.2048072562358276,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 31","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_031_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.031.jpeg","id":"356BD534-2CAB-42C0-9F39-78DB9CC6E475","slideTitle":"第31スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"その女性がそういうと、周りの女子たちが皆一斉に「おはようございます」と言い、礼をする。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":3.699546485260771,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 32","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_032_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.032.jpeg","id":"0811119E-FF1C-478D-83A0-07F350EBFA2D","slideTitle":"第32スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「おや…一人…はずれものがいますね…」\n私はそう言い、その男子に目線を合わせる。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":5.297777777777778,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 33","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_033_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.033.jpeg","id":"0E7442B4-0A1D-4833-8942-3FED6727C42F","slideTitle":"第33スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「あなたも、今日から、この学園の一員ですから、\n挨拶の練習でもしましょうか…、藤原さん。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":6.126848072562359,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 34","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_034_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.034.jpeg","id":"1D2C24CF-CF1C-4FC6-A050-11C24013512C","slideTitle":"第34スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕はそう言われ、僕に向けての声かけだったことに気づく。\n「あの…練習って…何をすればいいんですか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":30.612607709750566,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 35","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_035_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.035.jpeg","id":"CB09B582-E694-4052-A167-089CC38B3E60","slideTitle":"第35スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「そうですね…とりあえず、私の方に来てください。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":3.3775736961451246,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 36","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_036_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.036.jpeg","id":"A0F86EFA-0FC6-413F-AE2B-D7781A94AD2B","slideTitle":"第36スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、彼女の隣に立つ。\nすると、彼女が再び挨拶し、女子から挨拶と礼が返ってくる。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":6.356077097505669,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 37","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_037_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.037.jpeg","id":"B8D7141C-A3D7-4518-953B-AC17E8271EB4","slideTitle":"第37スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「彼女たちのように、あなたも私の挨拶に対して、\n挨拶とお辞儀で返すことはできますか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":5.734444444444445,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 38","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_038_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.038.jpeg","id":"E7426DF5-9729-4F6A-83C5-F7B8CD2C0B81","slideTitle":"第38スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕はそう言われ、どう返すべきかわからず、黙ってしまう…。\nすると、彼女がある女子を呼び、その女子は僕の反対側に立つ。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":8.040430839002267,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 39","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_039_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.039.jpeg","id":"9D53D6BC-8C16-4BFC-8FC8-E92ACD8D1B10","slideTitle":"第39スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「さとりさん、私が今から、『おはようございます。』と言いますので、彼に返しの挨拶とお辞儀の手本を見せてください。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":1.8664625850340135,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 40","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_040_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.040.jpeg","id":"378026F5-415C-4159-9A52-F681F1CEDE43","slideTitle":"第40スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8F%A4%E6%98%8E%E5%9C%B0%E3%81%95%E3%81%A8%E3%82%8A","telop":"「分かりました、早苗師匠。」\n私はそう返すと、彼女に言われた通りに、彼に手本を見せる。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/さとり（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"古明地さとり","voiceDuration":5.283378684807256,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 41","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_古明地さとり.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.041.jpeg","id":"1257E8B0-970C-45E9-A725-1E1DD68202B9","slideTitle":"第41スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「さて、お手本は見せました、今度はあなたの番ですよ、藤原さん。挨拶とお辞儀、出来ますか？」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":2.77702947845805,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 42","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.042.jpeg","id":"B7BE6502-45D2-45EF-8708-74BAE6C87A79","slideTitle":"第42スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、見よう見まねで挨拶とお辞儀をする。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.373469387755102,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 43","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.043.jpeg","id":"A6595276-17DA-4FA6-B262-86CEAD0EAFED","slideTitle":"第43スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「初日しては、上出来ですよ、藤原さん。それじゃあ、あなたのこれまでの人生について、10分間で言いましょう。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/早苗（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":3.8336054421768706,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 44","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.044.jpeg","id":"B990BAB5-38D6-486F-B9FD-D999590322C5","slideTitle":"第44スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"「分かりました…」僕はそう言われ、これまでの人生を振り返る。そのうち、スイッチが入ったように、その内容を語った。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/早苗（笑い）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.810430839002268,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 45","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.045.jpeg","id":"1BFEF716-996A-472B-8840-AB225B47D470","slideTitle":"第45スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E6%9D%B1%E9%A2%A8%E8%B0%B7%E6%97%A9%E8%8B%97","telop":"「今日の朝礼はこれで、終了です。今日から新年度ですので、心改めて、より良い自分を見せられるようにしましょう。」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"東風谷早苗","voiceDuration":3.756848072562358,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"東風谷早苗","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 46","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_東風谷早苗.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.046.jpeg","id":"58EB8D1F-EE7D-4E95-8069-EE88D81D948F","slideTitle":"第46スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"彼女はそういうと、その場を去っていった。すると、彼女にさとりと呼ばれていた、先程の女子が僕の元に駆け寄る。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":2.5191156462585034,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 47","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/r