_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_赤面.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.055.jpeg","id":"86DB0716-144C-4C5C-A274-F5C7402E208A","slideTitle":"第55スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%82%A4%E3%83%8A%E3%83%90","telop":"「とりあえず、あなたの教室に案内しますね…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/鈴仙（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"イナバ","voiceDuration":3.6094784580498867,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"イナバ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 56","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_霧雨魔理沙.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.056.jpeg","id":"FA9A31E4-ABF9-4092-9FE9-A0962F210EB4","slideTitle":"第56スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_sub","telop":"私はそう言われ、彼女と共に保健室を離れた。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/鈴仙（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":6.746485260770975,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"サブ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 57","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第26話\/一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"一人部屋３（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_十六夜咲夜.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.057.jpeg","id":"8D39C948-ED3C-4672-8450-9A534779F57A","slideTitle":"第57スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_sub","telop":"私が、彼女の案内で教室に戻ると、クラスメイトの視線が突き刺さるように飛んでくる。「まぁ…当たり前か…」","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"サブ","voiceDuration":9.121020408163265,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"サブ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 58","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_隠岐奈.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.058.jpeg","id":"916EDAF3-7D5E-46E0-AB36-E02E4469EB23","slideTitle":"第58スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%91%E3%83%81%E3%83%A5%E3%83%AA%E3%83%BC%E3%83%BB%E3%83%8E%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%82%B8","telop":"「あなた…見かけない顔ね…新入生かしら…」私は科学の講義中に突如として入ってきた彼女にそう問いかける。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/パチュリー真顔小口開け.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","voiceDuration":8.693038548752835,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2Sta