 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 152","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/教室の前の方（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"教室の前の方（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1524_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.152.jpeg","id":"A855761C-3C6E-4BE0-AA6C-45EA3DB651C5","slideTitle":"第152スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"だが、僕の場合は、その学校の空気を避けるための口実に、勉強をしていた。だが、それでも勉強の成果は出ていた。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTimeOffset":0,"voiceCharacter":"操夢","voiceDuration":7.597369614512472,"transitionName":"なし","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 153","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/教室の前の方（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"教室の前の方（日中）.jpg","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_1536_操夢.wav","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.153.jpeg","id":"47D2997B-B390-435C-9E66-18E703017A0D","slideTitle":"第153スライド"},{"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","telop":"そして、時が進むにつれて、なんらかの負担が僕にのしかかり、根幹的な僕の何かが崩れるような感覚を感じた。","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","seStartTime