h":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/寝起き顔.png","telop":"「…少しばかし、恥ずかしいです…」僕は、そう返すのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 617","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.617.jpeg","id":"62B07E3E-8F56-4230-8808-AE6748129A8B","slideTitle":"第617スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"その頃、霊夢は…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.618.jpeg","id":"CDBC682A-9CCD-4EFE-996F-0D16C634868E","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、この取調室でふと今朝のことを思い出していた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 619","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.619.jpeg","id":"7354FB1F-54CA-4FDE-989D-8E5F1A2F2F40","slideTitle":"第619スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"私は、家を出てから、魔理沙の家に着くと、彼女は、ため息をつきながら、どこか暗く感じる表情をしていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 620","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.620.jpeg","id":"9ED363D1-5059-44B7-B5F5-C84B88389550","slideTitle":"第620スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"私が、彼女にそんな表情をしている理由を問うと、昨晩の就寝時に、やけ酒をしていると、ふと不思議な声が聞こえたという。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 621","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.621.jpeg","id":"0D98ABA4-05C0-4CAF-AA80-30A9CDCE76B9","slideTitle":"第621スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"そして、気がつけば、赤信号の横断歩道を渡っており、彼が止めなければ、きっとあのまま車に轢かれていたという。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 622","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.622.jpeg","id":"54315F1F-BF6F-4C27-AA68-E6794A7D8659","slideTitle":"第622スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"私は、その症状が時折彼女に現れることを知っていて、だが、出来事が起きてから、翌朝には記憶から消えることを知っていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 623","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.623.jpeg","id":"0D8C30F3-8CFE-4A81-B4A5-3F6C005DF08C","slideTitle":"第623スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"だが、彼女はあの後も、悪夢に悩まされていて、今日1日を無事に過ごせるかが不安だというので、励まし、私は仕事に向かった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 624","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.624.jpeg","id":"F61BEB6D-5C34-4773-9289-540ED258D9B2","slideTitle":"第624スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/困り顔2.png","telop":"それから、時が進み、夕陽がさしていた頃、\n彼女が突如として私が勤めている神社に現れた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 625","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.625.jpeg","id":"6F62F456-C54E-40E0-B272-50EBBD2638FC","slideTitle":"第625スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/困り顔2.png","telop":"すると、彼女は、私にあることを聞いてくる。それは、以前の彼女なら気にすることもなかったはずの内容だった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 626","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.626.jpeg","id":"7FAE7EE7-D5BB-449A-B3FA-2697ADDBA826","slideTitle":"第626スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/困り顔2.png","telop":"今考えれば、それはある予兆だったのだとわかる。\nだが、その時の私は、再度、励ます程度で済ませてしまった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 627","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.pxd","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.627.jpeg","id":"5323BC73-C311-4B3D-86D0-E6B9E20BC973","slideTitle":"第627スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/具合の悪い顔.png","telop":"一応励ましたものの、様子が気になった私は、神社を早く出て、彼女を再度見ると、顔色が先ほどよりも悪くなっていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 628","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.628.jpeg","id":"ACBB12EA-4095-4568-B3E5-655FE3455996","slideTitle":"第628スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影のある笑顔2.png","telop":"そして、彼女は、ある言葉を私にいう。私は、その言葉に思わず彼女を平手打ちし、なぜそんなことを言うのかと問いただす。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 629","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image63.jpeg","backgroundName":"image63.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.629.jpeg","id":"5565EE1C-DF1E-49F5-BDEA-8FC2C3E4247A","slideTitle":"第629スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","telop":"すると、彼女は、謎に笑い出し、だんだんと様子が変わっていき、まるで悩みなどなかったように笑うと、ビームを出した。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 630","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","backgroundName":"473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.630.jpeg","id":"1F0B4B8F-5A1A-4193-BE83-BAA70B945708","slideTitle":"第630スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","telop":"結果的に、私は、彼女のビームを避けて、戦うことになってしまい、だんだんと周りのビル群に影響が出始めていった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 631","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","backgroundName":"4