":"サブ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 767","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.767.jpeg","id":"BB91446B-FE2B-4372-97BD-10D3EE867D94","slideTitle":"第767スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","telop":"「そう、なら案内するから、ついてきて。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 768","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.768.jpeg","id":"EA11D91C-DBBD-4E75-9EE8-A1C270325271","slideTitle":"第768スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","telop":"「ここが、図書館。取り出した本は、元の位置に戻してよ。」\n私は、そう言うと、私と彼の部屋に戻っていった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 769","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.769.jpeg","id":"4BD2DF88-7203-467C-AE41-95D15B1CFFC3","slideTitle":"第769スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「さてと…」私はそう言いながら、一息つくと、適当な本棚を眺めながら、図書館を歩き回るのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"サブ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 770","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.770.jpeg","id":"763BD480-A40B-4A2D-8B16-415767689D47","slideTitle":"第770スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"その頃、彼が元いた家では…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.771.jpeg","id":"9134E151-347F-49B9-8CDC-21D3E403033D","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、家に帰ってくるとため息をつく。例の騒動を鎮静化させる代わりに、魔理沙の面倒を私と彼で見ることになったからだ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 772","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.772.jpeg","id":"DF93A183-9831-4631-A8C7-2260F5BBDADA","slideTitle":"第772スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「私の母校は昔から何も変わってないわね…」\n私がそう呟いていると、インターホンが鳴る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 773","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","backgroundName":"リビング（夜・照明ON・カーテン閉）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.773.jpeg","id":"4B79439F-7429-4DFE-84DD-B185801F3D8B","slideTitle":"第773スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私が外に出ると、書留郵便物の受け渡しだった。しかも、発送日時が数時間前になっていて、即日夜間速達の印があった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 774","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.774.jpeg","id":"BF5F5275-1E49-43F0-A056-6149E4872CE1","slideTitle":"第774スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"即日夜間速達は、高い料金と引き換えに、夕方から夜にかけて出せば、日付が変わる前に届くと言うものだ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 775","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.775.jpeg","id":"89FCF3B1-744A-4170-9E0D-E7054C0FB0F3","slideTitle":"第775スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、ふとその封筒の宛名を見る。そこには、私と夫の名前があり、差出人には…ある建設会社の代表の名前があった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 776","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.776.jpeg","id":"05D7AED6-FB49-4CF5-9750-40715C2B721C","slideTitle":"第776スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私はふと、昨晩のことを思い出す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 777","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.777.jpeg","id":"ABB2777F-2784-4DEA-B296-C260F6C0713F","slideTitle":"第777スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","telop":"私がそれから外に出ると、そこには著名な建設会社の代表であるレミリアの姿があった。「あの、どうされました？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 778","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.778.jpeg","id":"025B168A-AA92-4FCC-BC8E-B53222296697","slideTitle":"第778スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","telop":"「実は、あなたの息子さんの将来に関わることで、\n折行ってご相談がありまして…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 779","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.779.jpeg","id":"F2633338-4232-49E8-9E44-94145E37CAA6","slideTitle":"第779スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（驚く）.png","telop":"「何の相談ですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 780","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.780.jpeg","id":"79D6F519-547A-4BE5-A3E0-AAF738A3C574","slideTitle":"第780スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/困った笑み.png","telop":"「実は…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 781","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.781.jpeg","id":"164FD420-C798-44EA-BF56-8B1F083EB2B4","slideTitle":"第781スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、それを思い出すと、その場で中身を見る。そこには、婚姻届のコピーがあった。私はそれを見ると、寝室に向かう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 782","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc235081_家（夜・灯りあり）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.782.jpeg","id":"C88CEC59-1B1B-4027-8205-5E53F5B89D39","slideTitle":"第782スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そして、魔理沙が家に来る前に取り出した、息子の部屋にあった書類や荷物、そして過去の記録物を取り出し、中身を確認する。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 783","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.783.jpeg","id":"475A2007-5C42-4585-A9FD-09CA60B1EFC9","slideTitle":"第783スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"その中身にある文字と、婚姻届の文字を比較する。どうやら、彼が書いたわけではなかった。「もしかしたら…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 784","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.784.jpeg","id":"EBF17A36-F12C-474B-B29D-3A36A938D6A5","slideTitle":"第784スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、取り出した書類や荷物の中から、入念深く探す。すると、あるものを見つける。その文字と婚姻届の文字は似通っていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 785","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.785.jpeg","id":"FA35C125-3807-48D8-BA84-C58EA4D98992","slideTitle":"第785スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、そこで気づく。いつの間にか、彼は、この家からいなくなったんだと。そして、時計を見ると、今日は土曜日だった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"博麗霊夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 786","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","backgroundName":"96ADD4DE-3714-521D-BE06-732A989A7431.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.786.jpeg","id":"8799026C-E72A-44B6-B8F2-C7B5AC07CF54","slideTitle":"第786スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、ふと気がつくと、そこはフランと僕の二人部屋だった。\nすると、扉が、突如として開き、誰かが入ってくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 787","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.787.jpeg","id":"F5DE7DB3-7672-421F-9565-06249FA797CC","slideTitle":"第787スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","telop":"「あら、目が覚めたの、紅夢くん…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 788","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynot