gePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、服を着るということが抜け落ちたまま、あたふたしていると、突如として扉をノックされ、レミリアの声が聞こえる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 798","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.798.jpeg","id":"172FC4E8-E57A-4794-9519-D82561821BCF","slideTitle":"第798スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「もう起きてるの、二人とも？起きているなら、返事をしなさい。じゃないと、勝手に扉を開けるわよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 799","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.799.jpeg","id":"7173197A-70F2-45C9-A3B9-11C91ADC3FA2","slideTitle":"第799スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、ふとフランの方を見ると、彼女は依然として裸のまますやすやと眠っていた。僕は、そのまま戸惑っていると、扉が開く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 800","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.800.jpeg","id":"CB80E05C-278D-42FA-8C9B-4D21D6D80448","slideTitle":"第800スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/驚き.png","telop":"そして、部屋に入ってきた彼女は、みるみるうちに頬を赤く染めていた。「あの…レミリアさん…僕は…どうすれば…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 801","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.801.jpeg","id":"5A7ED89D-01D0-4CA9-BF26-94FB14F20625","slideTitle":"第801スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","telop":"「とりあえず、服を着たらどうなの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 802","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.802.jpeg","id":"007D5127-F511-47A3-A964-FC4E7B85531D","slideTitle":"第802スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/困り顔小口開け.png","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう指摘され、自分が裸のままであることに気づく。そして、ベッドの下に服があり、それを取って切る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 803","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.803.jpeg","id":"43AAD0B3-18A1-4AD8-8A0D-285F29410200","slideTitle":"第803スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","telop":"「とりあえず、私は食堂に戻るから、あなたもフランを起こして、ささっと食堂に来なさい、そこでこの件は話しましょう。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 804","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.804.jpeg","id":"0EBB4544-D3A5-447F-BA39-811C126AA972","slideTitle":"第804スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"彼女はそういうと、部屋をさっていった。\nそれから、静けさが部屋に戻ると、フランが目を覚ます。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 805","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.805.jpeg","id":"0EA14770-728D-4874-AB9B-040A8DC72341","slideTitle":"第805スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「んっ…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 806","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.806.jpeg","id":"D5C1DCBF-630B-4E25-9C53-7DAAFD49CD75","slideTitle":"第806スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「あれ…ここは…」\n私は、そう言いながら、だんだんと頭が冴えてくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 807","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.807.jpeg","id":"D89FD632-78A1-42F0-A76E-EEC6AF61D4FF","slideTitle":"第807スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「紅夢くん…昨日はごめんなさい、真夜中に襲いかかって…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 808","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.808.jpeg","id":"D2ABAE7E-5A0A-4C72-9F7E-8BA16E97298F","slideTitle":"第808スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/寝起き顔.png","telop":"「それより、服を着てくれませんか…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 809","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.809.jpeg","id":"677115A6-6922-4C4A-A85A-AE21205A4F31","slideTitle":"第809スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「とりあえず、着替えるから、部屋から出てくれない？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 810","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.810.jpeg","id":"A6523F53-D418-4DD9-82A8-285001A19A9F","slideTitle":"第810スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/寝起き顔.png","telop":"「分かりました…、着替えたら食堂に来てください。僕は、先に食堂に向かっているので。」僕はそういうと、部屋を離れた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 811","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc244641_家の玄関ホール（日中）.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.811.jpeg","id":"116903F9-98B1-4545-8C4A-522331241241","slideTitle":"第811スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、それから食堂に来ると、すでに朝食の準備ができていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 812","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.812.jpeg","id":"B046D8BC-A577-4786-B526-DD4BDC6734AD","slideTitle":"第812スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"それから、10分程度でフランもやってくる。\nすると、挨拶を済ますと、3人で朝食を食べ始めた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 813","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.813.jpeg","id":"FBC3EAED-7387-4F9F-9369-512136E79545","slideTitle":"第813スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「それで、〇〇を卒業した気分を教えてくれるかしら、紅夢。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 814","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.814.jpeg","id":"77BD9D8F-0A2A-45B2-9B90-01F7823B4778","slideTitle":"第814スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","telop":"「あの、〇〇ってなんですか…？」\n僕は、フランが頬照りながら驚いている姿を見ながらいう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 815","animationName":"なし","duration":4.3,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.815.jpeg","id":"98DC1BA9-7FD5-404B-9178-A160F45E17C5","slideTitle":"第815スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「こんなこと言わなくてもわかるでしょ。それで、どうなの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 816","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.816.jpeg","id":"90954EEB-57C5-4155-AFC3-844B80BE274B","slideTitle":"第816スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","telop":"僕は、そういうとレミリアの表情と今までの会話から、その言葉の意味を推測する。「フランさんならわかると思いますが…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 817","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.817.jpeg","id":"7391F172-6999-46C8-A002-AE839A0AAABD","slideTitle":"第817スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc196979_食堂(昼).png","telop":"それから僕が二人に告げた、ある内容に二人は驚くのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 818","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.818.jpeg","id":"4B17E683-2D52-4A72-AB73-AD062F59B138","slideTitle":"第818スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"それから…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.819.jpeg","id":"275183CA-D79A-4FB8-B308-63C50BCA6815","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"それから、僕は、朝食を食べ終えて、身支度を整えると、フランに図書館の場所を聞いて、やってきた。そしてある本を探す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 820","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.820.jpeg","id":"4E221636-32D2-4A71-95E5-828FF83D0F91","slideTitle":"第820スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"それから、目的の本がありそうな棚を見つけ、その棚をはじから見ていく。「あった。」僕はそう言い、その本を取り出し戻る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 821","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","backgroundName":"04039E1E-32B0-5CF7-8D5F-42290235463E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.821.jpeg","id":"3E4C2A4D-F058-4258-A82F-727722486BC3","slideTitle":"第821スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そして、取り出した本は、「全国財閥高統一模試」の過去問集だった。そして、フランにもらった新品のノートを開く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 822","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.822.jpeg","id":"E0BDAD21-D3DB-486F-9B2C-10EC047044B7","slideTitle":"第822スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そこから、僕は遠足の2週間前に受ける、その試験に向けた勉強を黙々と、この大規模な図書館で進めていくのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 823","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","backgroundName":"nc77066_【背景素材】紅魔館大図書館.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.823.jpeg","id":"A498A7E3-BE4F-4C3A-93F8-A1161EFE7B5E","slideTitle":"第823スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"一方でフランとレミリアは…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.824.jpeg","id":"DBC43CB0-7088-4C34-B1C9-239EB62A60D6","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","telop":"「ねぇ、フラン。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 825","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.825.jpeg","id":"DA214A67-8A3A-4E2A-97D8-FDC70F6D2638","slideTitle":"第825スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「なに、お姉様？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 826","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.826.jpeg","id":"EDD918D0-A8EC-4697-8339-C1F130271D52","slideTitle":"第826スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/疑問顔.png","telop":"「フランは、昨晩の飲み会、どこまで覚えてるの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 827","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.827.jpeg","id":"6A33E553-5A39-4CFF-87D4-1A02475651E0","slideTitle":"第827スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「えっと…」私はそう言われ、記憶を遡る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 828","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.828.jpeg","id":"CDF3E171-F375-4C38-A717-4C89B25E37F7","slideTitle":"第828スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"昨晩、彼女が図書館に行った後、私とお姉様は、もともとこの屋敷に住んでいた咲夜たちとの飲み会に向かった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 829","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.829.jpeg","id":"EF162110-AE24-42BD-9027-591CF8A2583C","slideTitle":"第829スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"すると、始まってからすぐに、パチュリーが私に、祝いの言葉を告げる。その後、順々に言葉を聞き終えていく。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 830","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.830.jpeg","id":"19DAA61A-DABC-4615-B648-93EA21115BAF","slideTitle":"第830スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、彼女たちからの祝いの言葉に少し困惑する。\nなぜなら、彼との結婚が決まったわけではないからだ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 831","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.831.jpeg","id":"573B1217-0C69-49C0-887D-CE2E96E69C25","slideTitle":"第831スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"すると、咲夜が私になぜ、困っているかを聞いてくる。\n私が戸惑っていると、お姉様がそのことを伝える。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 832","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.832.jpeg","id":"5B36A6CF-E711-4872-9B3F-C9237F1363EC","slideTitle":"第832スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"その言葉に皆は、謝り、少しばかし空気が暗くなりかけてたところに、赤ワインとお通しが出てくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 833","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.833.jpeg","id":"BFE1D090-7C5D-4256-A419-335C062AD500","slideTitle":"第833スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"そして、それからしばらく経つと、お酒だけ飲んでいた私とお姉様は…、私はその先を思い出そうとするが、思い出せない。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 834","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","backgroundName":"nc228271_居酒屋の個室.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.834.jpeg","id":"F5C5ED4F-30DF-4BF4-9DDB-9D280A5D7213","slideTitle":"第834スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「確かに、あの時は、私とフランだけすでに食事を済ませて、酒だけをのが、原因なのは分かっている、けど…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 835","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.835.jpeg","id":"816D2552-126C-441C-B93A-D3AA49DA3BDA","slideTitle":"第835スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「私がフランにいう資格は、ないかもしれないけど、少しばかし、アルコールの自己管理くらい、出来たらどうかしら？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 836","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.836.jpeg","id":"BFD9350C-3091-40E5-8E0C-4A242BE9AFC7","slideTitle":"第836スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"私は、お姉様の指摘通りなので、頭を抱えて考える。だが、だんだんとオーバヒートしているような感覚がしてくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 837","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.837.jpeg","id":"99AC8FD7-4579-4C63-85D3-4A446EBC9BE0","slideTitle":"第837スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","telop":"私はそこで、「しまった」とつぶやく。だが、\nそう呟いている間にも、フランはこちらに攻撃をしてくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 838","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.838.jpeg","id":"B4C9A9C3-0490-4EAE-ADF0-E51E67FE6C51","slideTitle":"第838スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","telop":"私は、彼女の攻撃を避けながら、あるものを探す。\nすると、ハッと思い出し、その場所に向かい、疾走する。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 839","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.839.jpeg","id":"4B1BC77A-4C4D-469A-AD5A-A43A307AEE58","slideTitle":"第839スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（狂気）.png","telop":"そして、フランの攻撃を避けながら、なんとか取り出したそれを、フランの攻撃の隙をつき、ぷつっと刺す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 840","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","backgroundName":"nc107556_紅魔的館内.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.840.jpeg","id":"0471CDE7-A2BD-4F7A-99B7-813465EC754E","slideTitle":"第840スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「あれ…今私は、なにしてたんだっけ？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 841","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/