StartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 943","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.943.jpeg","id":"621B23F4-8814-4489-97B2-B0E2BDA2783D","slideTitle":"第943スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"僕は、彼女の意思を確認すると、過去を思い返しながら話す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 944","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.944.jpeg","id":"45A7F6B6-5B09-4E26-9D54-BEE186F7339B","slideTitle":"第944スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","telop":"「それで、あなたはこの学校に転校して、良かったですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 945","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.945.jpeg","id":"1088C976-716E-41FE-9155-849495CC0E99","slideTitle":"第945スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「ええ、前の学校と比べると、かなり良いです。母に、母の母校に転校したいと言って、良かったと僕は思っています。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 946","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.946.jpeg","id":"EAAD6C97-5306-4F21-92EF-E18A6C3268A0","slideTitle":"第946スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","telop":"「そうですか…、ところで話の節々から、あなたの記憶には、欠けているところがありますが、何か心当たりはありますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 947","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.947.jpeg","id":"68C0CF0B-B6E6-4A34-804A-3644F5BCA659","slideTitle":"第947スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「…正直に言って分からないです。小さかった頃は、それこそ些細な違いで、記憶が欠け始めたのは、中学からですから…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 948","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.948.jpeg","id":"71D8105E-4271-4FBB-92F7-AEA5B978FF6E","slideTitle":"第948スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「…ただ、証拠を出せというのなら、僕のこの身体が、それを示してます…、正直にいうと人様には見せたくないですが…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 949","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.949.jpeg","id":"F0C55BE0-349A-453F-9C1C-A87FD4DAAA10","slideTitle":"第949スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","telop":"「そうですか…。ところで、あなたは、この間の模試を受けている時の様子と、午後の1500m走の様子を見たいですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 950","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.950.jpeg","id":"5DBE9F1F-25BF-4780-BDCD-4BC01E275014","slideTitle":"第950スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「えっ？」僕は、彼女の急な質問に、そう返してしまう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 951","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.951.jpeg","id":"BCAEE5F8-D5A7-4BE9-B1DA-2ABF3D06C27A","slideTitle":"第951スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","telop":"「もし、見たいのなら、教員用のPCにデータが保存されているので、お見せできますが…、どうしますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 952","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.952.jpeg","id":"DE427748-A2EE-4A44-9139-700EBBAE34F3","slideTitle":"第952スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「えっと…」僕はふと迷う。確かに、こないだの気を失っている間に、自分が何をしてかを見たいが、見たくない気持ちもある。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 953","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.953.jpeg","id":"24A805CE-DD5F-4DD0-B12D-903232A8D94A","slideTitle":"第953スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/フラン困り後ろ手.png","telop":"「いや、いいです…」僕は、それから彼女にそう返す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 954","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.954.jpeg","id":"6422F8AD-A219-4480-9FE0-741EA47065B2","slideTitle":"第954スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/咲夜（微笑）.png","telop":"「そうですか…、最後に一つだけ、こないだ渡した例の遠足に関する条件ですが、無事に満たしましたよ、では失礼。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 955","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.955.jpeg","id":"42C98C29-A7E4-42A1-B24E-3C2BD74D831E","slideTitle":"第955スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"彼女はそういうと、部屋をさっていった。僕は、ゆっくりと立ちあがろうとすると、突如として頭痛が走り、床に崩れ落ちる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 956","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.956.jpeg","id":"C3066954-FDF9-4F64-88EA-037BD8ADDD07","slideTitle":"第956スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（驚く）.png","telop":"そして、僕の様子を見に戻ってきた彼女を、\n一瞬見ると、そのまま気を失うのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"十六夜咲夜","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 957","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第16話\/ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791195025_33546.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.957.jpeg","id":"4B8EB346-287B-4ABF-B047-48C814F337E6","slideTitle":"第957スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"彼がふと気がつくと…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.958.jpeg","id":"1AB329EC-0EA1-46C2-87AF-D889220C9C02","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕はふと気がつくと、そこはトイレだった。\nそして、手を洗ってから、トイレを出る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 959","animationName":"なし","duration":3.8000000000000003,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第14話\/ColabGPU_1791193839_80109.png","backgroundName":"ColabGPU_1791193839_80109.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.959.jpeg","id":"CE27B419-8BF7-4028-B680-7BE787622DCC","slideTitle":"第959スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そして、学校の廊下を歩いているときに、ふと午後は、全校集会だったことを思い出す。そして、僕は体育館に向かう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 960","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第14話\/nc485831_学校の廊下（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc485831_学校の廊下（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.960.jpeg","id":"3C39F72D-67B7-462A-BBB3-3C5F9EDEC8D1","slideTitle":"第960スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕が体育館に来ると、すでにほとんどの生徒や児童が集まっているようだった。僕は、ふと周りを見渡し、ある列に入る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 961","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.961.jpeg","id":"37BD24EE-EAA7-4EA7-B381-C9AFE607C535","slideTitle":"第961スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"それから、数時間の間、遠足の説明を聞くのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 962","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","backgroundName":"B3198052-32F7-5805-8AFC-BCCF2D49CA5B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.962.jpeg","id":"8551CB56-C3DE-4694-9966-C0A8F9E21D99","slideTitle":"第962スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"説明会が終わり…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.963.jpeg","id":"43BB1D98-2123-4860-B324-B5E53E5C59F2","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/早苗（微笑）.png","telop":"僕は、朝と同じように礼と挨拶をして、数分程度の短い週例を終えると、そのまま、学校の校門に向かう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 964","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/2026-10-04_16-42.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-04_16-42.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.964.jpeg","id":"4DA0C512-9606-4F87-BCAD-1C10866068B2","slideTitle":"第964スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕が、学校の校門に来ると、ある車が門の前に止まっていた。\nすると、中からフランが降りてくる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 965","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.965.jpeg","id":"7F8D4B9D-9D01-4450-91DF-46417A89360F","slideTitle":"第965スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"「学校、お疲れ様、紅夢。とりあえず、車に乗って。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 966","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.966.jpeg","id":"37E12FE9-C1EE-4871-9B33-C554CA36372C","slideTitle":"第966スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、車に乗ると、数十分で高速に入る。\n「あの、フランさん、どこに行くのですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 967","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第14話\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.967.jpeg","id":"CAD484CB-671C-43DC-8F89-19A0F787BF31","slideTitle":"第967スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（余裕）.png","telop":"「それは、向こうに着くまで秘密。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 968","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第14話\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.968.jpeg","id":"D25F49D1-930B-45BB-87D5-6AEE66A1F723","slideTitle":"第968スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は彼女にそう返され、前に向き直る。それから、僕はフランの隣の助手席で、ただぼーっと車窓を眺めるのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 969","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第14話\/02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","backgroundName":"02AD8E04-C216-5029-82B0-EA4A70A993B1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.969.jpeg","id":"E36AC481-649F-4509-8D42-AFE68E68CE40","slideTitle":"第969スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、フランに連れられて、とある山間のキャンプ場に来ていた。そして、僕は、彼女にキャンプ用品を持ってきたかを聞く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 970","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image53.jpeg","backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.970.jpeg","id":"EECA3DDE-45B7-4D9D-B0E7-D847129F7AC6","slideTitle":"第970スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"「もちろん、持ってきたよ。」私はそう言い、車からテントなどのキャンプ用品を取り出し、テントの設営をする。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 971","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image53.jpeg","backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.971.jpeg","id":"D5289BEB-F6E3-45D9-BFE5-A029A2A18BA5","slideTitle":"第971スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"それから、数分から数十分の間、彼女は黙々と、テントの設営やキャンプの準備を進めていく。「何か手伝いますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 972","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image53.jpeg","backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.972.jpeg","id":"FD648689-53B6-44DB-B294-8B8B929FEE6A","slideTitle":"第972スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"「いや、手伝わなくていいよ。そこらへんで座って、待ってて。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 973","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image53.jpeg","backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.973.jpeg","id":"3791A5D6-3631-4799-A1D0-E550DC530533","slideTitle":"第973スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、彼女がそう返すと、彼女の作業の邪魔にならない位置で、座って、その作業が終わるまで、周囲を見渡すのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 974","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image53.jpeg","backgroundName":"image53.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.974.jpeg","id":"3BDCF7DB-1151-470A-B621-E08D83AC0DC8","slideTitle":"第974スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"テントの設営が終わり、夕日が静まると、フランはあらかじめ準備されていた食材とフライパンを焚き火の上に置く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 975","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image55.jpeg","backgroundName":"image55.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.975.jpeg","id":"2ECD96B2-61E8-458D-A61E-7D8C9EFA0559","slideTitle":"第975スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/フラン（笑い）.png","telop":"「今晩は、ステーキ丼だよ、紅夢。」\n私はそう言いながら、飯盒を乗せて、お肉を一緒に焼く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 976","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image55.jpeg","backgroundName":"image55.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.976.jpeg","id":"E9CAD025-A781-4054-A2E8-9A664108EA87","slideTitle":"第976スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/フラン（笑い）.png","telop":"僕は、彼女がそういうと、焚き火の上に置かれた食材を眺める。そして、ふと空を見上げる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 977","animationName":"なし","duration":4.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/image55.jpeg","backgroundName":"image55.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.977.jpeg","id":"CCD25762-28FA-4D24-821F-2BCFFC8AA7F6","slideTitle":"第977スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そこには、満点の星空が広がっていた。僕は、\nその星空を無言で、眺めていると、フランが声をかける。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 978","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.978.jpeg","id":"415CD72C-A82A-4463-AA39-6D6F0451152F","slideTitle":"第978スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"「どう、満点の星空を見た感想は？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 979","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.979.jpeg","id":"777E8A5A-5C4A-47EF-B6AD-50869CF33A73","slideTitle":"第979スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（微笑）.png","telop":"「車を数時間走らせて、やってきた価値がありますよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 980","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.980.jpeg","id":"8A38C2F7-7A54-45A3-9666-8AFED5CA4BED","slideTitle":"第980スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/フラン（笑い）.png","telop":"「そうでしょ。それで、ご飯食べた後は、何する？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffs