ルっぽい頬照り余裕.png","telop":"「ああ、もちろんだぜ、霊夢。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1033","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc256896_病室-昼.png","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1033.jpeg","id":"53DD288F-C24B-4006-88AE-FA016A5523AF","slideTitle":"第1033スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/バトルっぽい頬照り余裕.png","telop":"二人は、何かの確認をすると、いきなり私の服を掴んでくる。\nそして、まんまと服を脱がされると、二人も服を脱ぐ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"藤原妹紅","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1034","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc256896_病室-昼.png","backgroundName":"nc256896_病室-昼.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1034.jpeg","id":"FC67879B-25A6-4DCA-A3E2-94449D3A0B81","slideTitle":"第1034スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そして、霊夢が私のベッドで、上を向いたまま横になると、魔理沙が私の手を引っ張り、霊夢、魔理沙、私の順で重なる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"藤原妹紅","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1035","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroun