_84dcf932f7.1176.jpeg","id":"CB7965E7-6EA4-481D-8A05-C5A206070AF0","slideTitle":"第1176スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そして、店内には、きっとその場所で使うことを想定されている洋服がずらりと並んでいた。そこまで見ると、視線を戻す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1177","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1177.jpeg","id":"C04A7A69-24E9-4FB8-871A-7180078D2D22","slideTitle":"第1177スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/照れ小口開け.png","telop":"「紅夢…、そのお店で洋服を見てきてもいい？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1178","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","backgroundName":"nc230307_ショッピングモール.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1178.jpeg","id":"2B4D49C9-1582-42EB-8F1E-EBDF0C17CF9F","slideTitle":"第1178スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/照れ小口開け.png","telop":"「ちなみに、そのお金は…？」\n僕は、二人が財布が手元にないを知った上で、そう聞く。","seStar