"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"すると、再び部屋の扉がノックされる。\n「いいぞ、入ってきなさい。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1272","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1272.jpeg","id":"D60CAC6C-1254-452F-81D6-3E30A66CE847","slideTitle":"第1272スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","telop":"「学園長…、その手元の書類の控えとデビットカードを送ったのは、あなたって本当なのですか？総理大臣からの認可は？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1273","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1273.jpeg","id":"1D136969-6EB5-48E6-9345-E6F9EE4135A9","slideTitle":"第1273スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「えっと、それはだな…」私は、彼女の指摘に言葉が詰まる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1274","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1274.jpeg","id":"E6981474-757D-4D13-ACF7-401A849891C0","slideTitle":"第1274スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","telop":"「まさか…、認可も取らずに、独断で実行されたんですか…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1275","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1275.jpeg","id":"2A5B0098-2277-4E4E-941C-64F6CF8F2E7C","slideTitle":"第1275スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「うぐっ。」私は、彼女の言う通りで何も言えなくなる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1276","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1276.jpeg","id":"32FE8482-336A-4AAC-ABF9-14DBB6234BB0","slideTitle":"第1276スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/目閉じ困る.png","telop":"「万が一の時には学園長の責任ですからね…、まったく…。ここ最近の学園長は彼に、固執しすぎじゃないですか…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1277","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1277.jpeg","id":"56517F99-8754-4572-8522-03F7647D45BC","slideTitle":"第1277スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「確かに、お前の言うとおりかも知れないな…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1278","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1278.jpeg","id":"BB768C55-A792-485B-9E13-FE8486AF0AC7","slideTitle":"第1278スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「だが、彼に固執するのには、理由があるんだよ、美鈴。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1279","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1279.jpeg","id":"457AB498-5482-440F-BEA3-F492E5F62078","slideTitle":"第1279スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","telop":"「いったい、どんな理由ですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1280","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1280.jpeg","id":"BE2531F0-0775-4183-9B13-8DD447871BD4","slideTitle":"第1280スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「その理由は、今度教えるから。この話は、ここでやめだ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1281","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1281.jpeg","id":"A509BBC3-60D4-4F5A-83D2-47E186E0CB50","slideTitle":"第1281スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/美鈴（困る）.png","telop":"「そうですか…、それでは失礼します…。」\n私はそう言うと、部屋を出て行った。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"美鈴","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1282","animationName":"なし","duration":3.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1282.jpeg","id":"3DDCD785-A439-4B5B-A356-A8F69FE974F7","slideTitle":"第1282スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕たちは、蒲田のホテルで一泊をすると、そのまま空港に向かい、さとりとこいし、僕とアリスで別れて２ペアで並んで座る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1283","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1283.jpeg","id":"3A4C1AFE-7F6C-46F1-BE4B-48B016F42A20","slideTitle":"第1283スライド"},{"telop":"「そういえば、アリスさんは、飛行機に乗るのは初めてですか？」僕は、ふと気になったので、彼女にそう尋ねる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1284","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1284.jpeg","id":"DE3DA2B8-AEFC-45B6-8B95-CAB6E7B06B37","slideTitle":"第1284スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/アリス（微笑）.png","telop":"「いや、学校での修学旅行で何度か、乗ったわ…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1285","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1285.jpeg","id":"303E45AC-74A7-4978-9B96-ABE99C87563E","slideTitle":"第1285スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/バトルっぽい頬照り余裕.png","telop":"「そうなんですね…、僕は小学生くらいまでは、\n家族で何度か、飛行機に乗って沖縄に行ってましたが…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1286","animationName":"なし","duration":4.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1286.jpeg","id":"44F37E01-3E36-480B-A383-6ADD882752DC","slideTitle":"第1286スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/バトルっぽい頬照り余裕.png","telop":"僕たちが、そんな会話をしていると、機内アナウンスで扉が閉まったことが知らされ、それから少しずつ飛行機は動き始めた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1287","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","backgroundName":"5C6EB196-8DBE-56CE-96F3-C47438B1D16B.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1287.jpeg","id":"2C5DD861-CCE9-4743-9309-60E97E2C3B29","slideTitle":"第1287スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"僕たちは、沖縄につき、空港を出ると、すでに手配済みだったレンタカーに乗り込む。昨日のホテルで手続きは既に済ませた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1288","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1288.jpeg","id":"7C373E6D-64C1-496E-B6B0-A09DC8AFF950","slideTitle":"第1288スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/アリス（微笑）.png","telop":"「それで、これからどこに向かうの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1289","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1289.jpeg","id":"89DC9B8E-44D4-4EC9-B1E3-35D65BFDA1D5","slideTitle":"第1289スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第30話\/バトルっぽい頬照り余裕.png","telop":"「今日と、帰る日の前日は、国際通り沿いのホテルなので、今日は南部中心ですが、アリスさんは希望はありますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1290","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1290.jpeg","id":"5349164F-8A8C-48A5-8FA2-F6C561CE4B59","slideTitle":"第1290スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「私は…」私は彼の質問にどう返すべきか迷う。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1291","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1291.jpeg","id":"B5B4299E-34D5-4E2D-A3C5-65D7C087BDAA","slideTitle":"第1291スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/アリス（微笑）.png","telop":"「出来れば、海中道路に行きたいわ…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1292","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1292.jpeg","id":"5769A182-51AD-4687-9AD1-0D4B1