319スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困る）.png","telop":"僕は、二人がそう言い、歩き出すと、彼女を抱えたまま、僕も歩こうとする。だがその瞬間に、大きな負荷が僕にかかる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1320","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image59.jpeg","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1320.jpeg","id":"603E4642-9ACC-4D1D-A8E1-C79E20B0507E","slideTitle":"第1320スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困る）.png","telop":"「あの、降ろしてもらえませんか、紅夢さん…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1321","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image59.jpeg","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1321.jpeg","id":"0E20C0FE-03D2-4650-85B6-888BFD8BF860","slideTitle":"第1321スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/アリス（困る）.png","telop":"「えっ？」僕は一瞬、彼女が何を言っているのかが分からなかったが、すぐに理解し、そっと階段の上に彼女を下ろす。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1322","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image59.jpeg","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1322.jpeg","id":"16D42886-3D17-45EA-910F-168755ABC61A","slideTitle":"第1322スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"すると、彼女は足早に車に戻って行った。「えっ…」\n僕は、そう呟いてから、再びくしゃみをすると、車に戻った。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1323","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/image59.jpeg","backgroundName":"image59.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1323.jpeg","id":"1380330F-2E38-44C2-BA47-F15E57F0051B","slideTitle":"第1323スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"僕は、車に戻ると、元々座っていた助手席に座り、シートベルトを締める。そして、彼女はそれから車のエンジンをつける。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1324","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1324.jpeg","id":"19AA5975-3D94-4879-936D-A60BD4BFA2C6","slideTitle":"第1324スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"それから、海中道路を一度渡り切り、Uターンして戻る。\nその最中、彼女が、心配そうな声で、僕に話しかける。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1325","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1325.jpeg","id":"B1B90C2D-D871-4EBE-AAD1-9FE649B047E6","slideTitle":"第1325スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「あの…、大丈夫？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1326","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1326.jpeg","id":"21CAFE49-2DE2-4D32-9D01-CB7C0846FD8D","slideTitle":"第1326スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「少しばかし、風邪を引いたかも…しれません。とりあえず、国際通りに行きませんか？そしたら、ちょうどお昼だし…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1327","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1327.jpeg","id":"A54AD8C8-CB76-4938-8F14-4547C5B9890C","slideTitle":"第1327スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「確かに、そうしましょうか…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1328","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1328.jpeg","id":"FD63DAF2-8EBA-48EA-80A8-33EAC256E226","slideTitle":"第1328スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"僕たちは、それから、国際通りに向かった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1329","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc284290_自動車の車内（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1329.jpeg","id":"062A9A3C-F41E-444E-A653-EF1C2A5CD075","slideTitle":"第1329スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"彼らが国際通りに着くと…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1330.jpeg","id":"16811C34-4642-470D-BCE4-CEE4201C74FE","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"僕たちはそれから、今日と帰る日の前日に泊まるホテルの駐車場に車を停めて、駐車場の中を歩いていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1331","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","backgroundName":"473B4704-DE27-5D98-945D-7E43A3042370.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1331.jpeg","id":"8AD02D85-7083-41C1-A2BE-E1B2961E08BE","slideTitle":"第1331スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"そして、ホテルのフロントに来ると、旅行券のコピーと、身分証を見せる。すると、部屋のキーカードを受け取り、歩き出す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1332","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/_.jpg","backgroundName":"_.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1332.jpeg","id":"6DC23FD7-74C0-4634-A2F6-B62E7FCA85EA","slideTitle":"第1332スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「それで、部屋2つありますが、部屋割りはどうしますか？」\n僕は、そうさとり、こいし、アリスの3人に尋ねる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1333","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1333.jpeg","id":"DF240FF0-EBA4-425B-A71A-E066330BC7BB","slideTitle":"第1333スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「それってつまり、誰かしら一人は、紅夢さんと同じ部屋になるってことかしら？」私は、確認のためにそう彼に聞く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1334","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1334.jpeg","id":"9A5FC459-C4E3-4264-8263-BED7E1E0FEA8","slideTitle":"第1334スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「ええ、僕の希望はないので、三人で決めてもらえますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1335","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1335.jpeg","id":"F2F11532-5963-4AC5-A0EC-AA33EF09602A","slideTitle":"第1335スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「私は、さとりさんとこいしさんが、\n一緒の部屋がいいなら、それで構わないけど…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1336","animationName":"なし","duration":3.9000000000000004,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1336.jpeg","id":"924B4006-88F0-4373-91D3-8408429C9DD0","slideTitle":"第1336スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「私は、できるだけこいしと同じ部屋がいいわ…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1337","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1337.jpeg","id":"4996CBAC-A69A-464F-90C6-D9CA2C6F4442","slideTitle":"第1337スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「それで、こいしさんは…、どうですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1338","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1338.jpeg","id":"1AEF6795-05DD-4054-977F-3510506C3231","slideTitle":"第1338スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/困り顔.png","telop":"「私は…」私はそう言いかけて、言葉が止まる。\nそして、ふと彼とエンドレスランをした日のことを思い出す…。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1339","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1339.jpeg","id":"27259AD3-990F-4C9C-BEF6-D78270FADFC4","slideTitle":"第1339スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私たちが、走り始めてから、最初の校門を出て曲がるまでは、\n特に問題なく、比較的にスムーズに走れていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1340","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/ペーストされた画像.tiff","backgroundName":"ペーストされた画像.tiff","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1340.jpeg","id":"2D5CDC3A-3A20-4C99-A589-709A7B785548","slideTitle":"第1340スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"だが、1kmあたりを過ぎると、だんだんと、彼と私のペースに翳りが見え始め、後方にいた美鈴先生がその問題を指摘する。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1341","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1341.jpeg","id":"FB7EE91E-5C28-4DAB-86DC-A181CFF3DAD9","slideTitle":"第1341スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"そこまでは、単純に走って疲れて、歩いているだけ、だった。\nだが、歩き始めて少し経つと、彼が急に走り出す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1342","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1342.jpeg","id":"65E93186-1146-4F96-B035-2E10FF1E5302","slideTitle":"第1342スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、慌てて彼について行こうとすると、彼の手がぶつかる。\n私はあのときドキッとし、そして、口走り、そのまま走り出す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1343","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc367698_住宅街２（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1343.jpeg","id":"87C99F36-0DB9-4551-8861-7BD20116E31F","slideTitle":"第1343スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"だが、さらに1kmがたつと、今度は足元にある石ころにこける。\nそして、次の瞬間には、彼に抱っこされていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1344","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1344.jpeg","id":"F8488CB0-23D7-4921-9180-A78C0924438D","slideTitle":"第1344スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"それからだろうか…、私は、今までの学校生活では全くと言っていいほど、感じなかった気持ちが心から湧き出していた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1345","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第4話\/nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc240173_住宅街（日中）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1345.jpeg","id":"057C9A59-D5DF-4FF7-A64F-94E70FFDE006","slideTitle":"第1345スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"私は、ふと意識が現実に戻ると、彼が困った表情で、私の名前を読んでいた。「私は…紅夢と…」私は、続けて言葉を放つ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1346","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1346.jpeg","id":"3D617B5F-9A5C-4503-BFB6-5D9B85F6959A","slideTitle":"第1346スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"「こいし…、一体どんな変化があったのよ…」\n私は、妹が発した予想外なその言葉に、そう返す。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1347","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1347.jpeg","id":"8DF38AB7-D47D-4AFC-BC88-672C44223223","slideTitle":"第1347スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"僕は、こいしの発言に驚きながらも、念の為に、他の二人に確認をとる。「それで、部屋割りはどうしますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1348","animationName":"なし","duration":5.1000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1348.jpeg","id":"E314C336-67E3-4C58-9C29-E804788FFDC6","slideTitle":"第1348スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「あの…、もしこいしさんと紅夢さんが同じ部屋になるのなら、私との約束は、どうなるのかしら…。」私は、そう彼に聞く。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1349","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1349.jpeg","id":"53DE4112-C5B9-4D61-B1E5-CFD9750900BB","slideTitle":"第1349スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"僕は、アリスのその指摘で思い出す。「確かにそうですね…」\n僕は、そう言いながら、考える。だが、くしゃみが再び出る。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1350","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1350.jpeg","id":"CC4E4F88-C3C9-4F7F-A76D-B74C474F4F6C","slideTitle":"第1350スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"「今日の昼食は、各自で準備でも構いませんか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1351","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1351.jpeg","id":"3BC771D1-C0B1-40FB-B4ED-AA984E762522","slideTitle":"第1351スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"「それで、構いませんよ。とりあえず、紅夢さんの、風邪を治すのが、先ですし…、ただこいしの発言にも…答えてくれますか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1352","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1352.jpeg","id":"EA51D951-AA3D-4F8E-B3F8-3B14C302AD44","slideTitle":"第1352スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"「じゃあ、誰と寝るかは、夕食後に決めるとして、とりあえず今は、僕とこいしさん、さとりさんとアリスさんでいいですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1353","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1353.jpeg","id":"14A7839B-3EB3-4050-9EFC-C514247C96BB","slideTitle":"第1353スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「ええ、そうしましょうか…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1354","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1354.jpeg","id":"1E47792B-6F1A-4896-985A-E76C6D03C392","slideTitle":"第1354スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/こいし（笑い）.png","telop":"それから、僕とこいし、アリスとさとりに分かれて部屋に入って行き、各自昼食をとり、それからは、休憩の時間になった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1355","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","backgroundName":"nc352037_ホテルの廊下1.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1355.jpeg","id":"EB59E33D-AD29-4455-902F-34F9F9AF487F","slideTitle":"第1355スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","telop":"僕とこいしが部屋に入ると、僕は、浴室に入り、湯船をため、\n浴室を出ると、こいしがもじもじとしていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1356","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1356.jpeg","id":"4728E4C2-B14A-459D-852C-C21AB23A73FB","slideTitle":"第1356スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","telop":"「どうしたんですか、こいしさん…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1357","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1357.jpeg","id":"E7A9EE6D-B59A-4F30-AA8A-DF2A8C61FDFB","slideTitle":"第1357スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/照れ小口開け.png","telop":"「こいしって呼んで…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartT