":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1467","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1467.jpeg","id":"5116B9C3-35C2-476E-AEEA-CF4798C20358","slideTitle":"第1467スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、僕に関することをいろいろ聞いてきた。両親のことや、前の学校、そして最後にフランとの関係について。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1468","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1468.jpeg","id":"0CE15C86-B863-4B45-BA8B-D4E8A1A58178","slideTitle":"第1468スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"「あなたのことが、よく分かったわ。とりあえず、向こうに折り返しの電話を、かけなさい。聞きたいことがまだあるから。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1469","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1469.jpeg","id":"38E5581B-BEA9-42A8-B49F-4F793A4C7135","slideTitle":"第1469スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"僕は、彼女にそう言われ、受話器を取ると、フランたちの家電にかけてもらい、その後彼女が、フランたちに長電話をしていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1470","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第21話\/image60.jpeg","backgroundName":"image60.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1470.jpeg","id":"BD45804F-DE88-443B-B7E5-F3F22F841A53","slideTitle":"第1470スライド"},{"telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"一方、さとりとアリスの部屋では…","animationName":"なし","duration":2.5,"backgroundName":"単色背景","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1471.jpeg","id":"A81BAD84-F619-4B7F-B8AB-91B0131E306D","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、暇つぶしにテレビを見ていると、ある速報が流れる。\n私は、その速報を見ると、妹の部屋に向かう。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"