15-AA28-4B6C-9766-755940E15DF0","slideTitle":"第1538スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"僕たちは、そんな話をしていると、玄関のチャイムが鳴る。\nすると、扉が開き、さとりとこいしが入ってきた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1539","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/image68.jpeg","backgroundName":"image68.jpeg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1539.jpeg","id":"CB4A2468-9C73-4E39-AC16-FEF56C816882","slideTitle":"第1539スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"すると、彼女はある書面を机上に置き、ペンを僕に渡し、サインをするように言ってくる。僕は、その書面の内容を読む。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1540","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1540.jpeg","id":"220F284B-EA0F-4203-90B3-C5DC276A0832","slideTitle":"第1540スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「それで、あなたはこの内容に同意してくれるの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1541","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1541.jpeg","id":"0F0072D6-2E6A-4D01-8319-A5B36A0D410C","slideTitle":"第1541スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"僕は、その書面に記された文章を見る。書面の下には、彼女のサインと何かの印章が貼られていた。すると、彼女が急かす。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1542","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1542.jpeg","id":"1D1C2DFD-DE1A-4C0E-A101-0BF5CC273304","slideTitle":"第1542スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「まだ？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1543","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1543.jpeg","id":"FC1D2F8F-7D1B-491C-B59C-3DEA137B3C8D","slideTitle":"第1543スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「この内容…、フランさんたちは知ってるんですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1544","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1544.jpeg","id":"B979ACAC-5F2F-49B5-A5D3-FF60FECC6B2F","slideTitle":"第1544スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「ええ、彼女たちに宣戦布告したのよ。昨日も言ったけど、もう以前の関係には戻れない、これは…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1545","animationName":"なし","duration":4.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1545.jpeg","id":"17249D82-5295-4EA1-918A-21DD004D4675","slideTitle":"第1545スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"そこまで言うと、彼女は頬を赤らめ、数秒の間の後、言う。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1546","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1546.jpeg","id":"FB8784E3-33DA-40AB-8BED-B5928CB3E4DC","slideTitle":"第1546スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「これは…、あなたの結婚相手…いや、後継をめぐる紅魔建設と私たち…、地下底国グループが戦うための文書なのよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1547","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1547.jpeg","id":"17432483-5DEB-4604-AF67-81F1E31C12AE","slideTitle":"第1547スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「それに、学校側だって、あなたが欲しいから、きっとこの戦いに参戦してくるわ。あなたは、その戦いの主軸なのよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1548","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1548.jpeg","id":"6063CEF1-FFF8-418A-B065-226A0DDC1A80","slideTitle":"第1548スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「…」僕は、次々と述べられる彼女の言葉の意味をうまく受け取れずに、ただ困惑してしまう。そして、さとりに視線を向ける。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1549","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1549.jpeg","id":"C882C08D-8B10-4EA5-A680-8A6D5608F36F","slideTitle":"第1549スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「これは…、一体どう言うことですか…、さとりさん…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1550","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1550.jpeg","id":"451AA634-A9D3-4005-81BC-4E333E6B70CB","slideTitle":"第1550スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「あなたが、昨日、妹の裸を見たことで、私たちの中での決まりが、あなたにも適用されたんですよ、強制ではないですが…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1551","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1551.jpeg","id":"74F4D7A3-83AA-485C-8BFE-A867792978A0","slideTitle":"第1551スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「あと、あなたの母親のところも、後継者の関係で、あなたを引き戻したいそうよ。だから、四つ巴の戦いなのよ…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1552","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1552.jpeg","id":"6FD9FA26-F994-43C4-B97B-4D462546F4CA","slideTitle":"第1552スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「簡単に言えば、私たちとあなたどう言う関係なのかを明白にし、戦いの混乱を避けるための同意が必要なんですよ…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"さ&り","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1553","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1553.jpeg","id":"20DB1742-BAF1-4DB0-861D-35E7BF0AA89E","slideTitle":"第1553スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"僕は、さとりの補足説明で、彼女たちが言いたいことを大まかに把握する。「別に構いませんけど…、一つだけいいですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1554","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1554.jpeg","id":"60DEB5F7-C016-4FA9-842C-66957EF5D201","slideTitle":"第1554スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「どんな条件なの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1555","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1555.jpeg","id":"54500C15-6620-4857-B659-8D4F9599D9A6","slideTitle":"第1555スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（不満）.png","telop":"「向こうに帰るまでは、これまで通りで過ごしませんか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1556","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1556.jpeg","id":"BB771D15-5EDB-4F22-A0CE-0B4BB6851B0F","slideTitle":"第1556スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"僕がそう言うと、二人は驚く。そして、二人の賛同を得た後、書面にサインを記して、恩納村へと向かうのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1557","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1557.jpeg","id":"9B7DDD76-F412-45CF-90E6-D09D9D865CA4","slideTitle":"第1557スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"中学生","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1558.jpeg","id":"34DB9431-B30D-4F04-A9EA-B145719FCD63","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"私とお姉様は、昨日、こいしからの長電話を受けた後、夜通し、今後の事を話し合って行った。「それで、どうするの…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1559","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1559.jpeg","id":"C87BEEB3-E30C-4BD4-BAB9-04D86F6C8A28","slideTitle":"第1559スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","telop":"「なんで彼は、あんな巨大組織の令嬢の裸を見たのかしら…。\nたとえ、アクシデントでもあんなことを言うなんて…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1560","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1560.jpeg","id":"975662FB-8C54-4B35-9188-C7E701995217","slideTitle":"第1560スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（怒る）.png","telop":"「とにかく、彼が旅行から戻ってきたら、厳しく言いつけて、戦いに勝って、私たちの方に、なんとしてでも引き込むわよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1561","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1561.jpeg","id":"835B6770-44E6-4B9A-B3D3-A11980DDE3FE","slideTitle":"第1561スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「私だって、彼がいなくなるのは嫌だし、お姉様に協力する。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1562","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1562.jpeg","id":"AF8B1570-44D4-4FE1-B1A3-163B7B8F0653","slideTitle":"第1562スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/レミリア（余裕）.png","telop":"「いいこと思いついたわ、フラン。何かしらの口実をつけて、学校と彼の母親を裏切る前提で味方につけなさい。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1563","animationName":"なし","duration":5.2,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1563.jpeg","id":"F0D6A766-0E0F-425C-9D5F-12EFC08654E1","slideTitle":"第1563スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「えっ…、そんなことして大丈夫なの？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1564","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1564.jpeg","id":"2E815A60-E86A-4571-8FE6-098CCC5AD914","slideTitle":"第1564スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/レミリア（余裕）.png","telop":"「いいのよ別に、これは女同士の泥沼試合なのだから。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1565","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1565.jpeg","id":"4EF1BB1C-C894-4FD4-BD74-D35EDB9292BF","slideTitle":"第1565スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/フラン（弱る）.png","telop":"「そう…わかった。」\n私はそれから、お姉様の言うとおりに動くのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1566","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","backgroundName":"1A54FDC5-F240-5222-A72C-C38DABF3999E.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1566.jpeg","id":"E6EFA56F-F5DB-4AD1-ACDD-4795D78EFBA7","slideTitle":"第1566スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"紅魔建設の破壊作業員","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/夜のお誘い.png","backgroundName":"夜のお誘い.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1567.jpeg","id":"BD41804A-F010-45A7-A6F2-99985F9C0BCB","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"私は、ふとため息を学園長室でついていた。「はぁ…」\n理由は明白で、昨晩にあった、ある電話である。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1568","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","backgroundName":"BE81E0CE-58E8-5C94-87E2-1680044AF26C.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1568.jpeg","id":"3141C523-F20E-4916-823F-2A9375630F3A","slideTitle":"第1568スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（弱る）.png","telop":"私が、昨日、残業で職務をこなしていると、一本の電話が入る。\nそれを知らせにきた、萃香はいかにも面倒そうな顔をしていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1569","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1569.jpeg","id":"042499A3-22C3-434F-8F6F-5DA07BF015C1","slideTitle":"第1569スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（弱る）.png","telop":"私は、彼女の言葉を受けると、内線を繋ぎ、相手の声を聞く。\nその声は、中等部の女子生徒、古明地こいしの声だった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1570","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1570.jpeg","id":"2A773701-B1BA-41EF-8937-46319A43FCA1","slideTitle":"第1570スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（弱る）.png","telop":"私は、電話越しに彼女が起こっていることを感じ、なぜ起こっているのかと聞く。すると例の彼が、彼女の裸を見たと言う。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1571","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1571.jpeg","id":"BEB3DC4E-7C03-4D04-8A6E-C630A20B0515","slideTitle":"第1571スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"私と萃香は驚きながらも、相手の話を聞く。すると、彼女はある衝撃的な発言を言ってきた。私は、その内容に困惑する。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1572","animationName":"なし","duration":5.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1572.jpeg","id":"E7D0AF55-BB03-49F2-94AB-F0C1003FF460","slideTitle":"第1572スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"だが、すぐに永琳からの電話も飛んできて、\n私はこいしの電話を保留にし、そちらに切り替える。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1573","animationName":"なし","duration":4.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1573.jpeg","id":"5C0A05D6-2D8A-45BC-A224-3D5569501BB9","slideTitle":"第1573スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"永琳が言うには、彼は貴重な研究対象だから、学園から話さずに、学校側の手が届く範囲でいさせたいとの要望だった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1574","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1574.jpeg","id":"8B3E2274-2F9B-4E9C-9E24-2959E9586B39","slideTitle":"第1574スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"私は、彼が貴重な人物であることは認識していたが、それほど重要性の高い人物だとは、正直に言って感じてなかった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1575","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1575.jpeg","id":"464492B9-CCB8-4198-972C-9DF998459DD2","slideTitle":"第1575スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"私は、一通り永琳の意見を聞き終えると、こいしの方に再度、切り替える。すると、彼女は、これは戦いだと、言ってきた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1576","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1576.jpeg","id":"A21BE42C-C4ED-4313-9813-22F74A6CE925","slideTitle":"第1576スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"そして、彼女は控えめだったが、もし彼女たちの要請に応じられないなら、学園の資金提供などの協力は打ち切ると言ってきた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1577","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1577.jpeg","id":"668908DC-30AB-4175-8B92-612F9821E45B","slideTitle":"第1577スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"どうやらすでに、彼女の両親がトップに鎮座する地下底国グループの意見を聞き取り、グループの見解になったそうだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1578","animationName":"なし","duration":5.6000000000000005,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1578.jpeg","id":"A8DECF65-A3C1-496A-A232-B04BC73922BA","slideTitle":"第1578スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"地下底国グループは、その名の通り、この社会の土台や裏側を幅広く、汎用的に事業を展開し支える巨大組織である。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"隠岐奈","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1579","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/2026-11-10_17-38.png","backgroundName":"2026-11-10_17-38.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1579.jpeg","id":"96D85FED-CBA8-446B-A5E7-25F30F6F7460","slideTitle":"第1579スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/萃香（驚く）.png","telop":"彼女は、今までその名では行動することはなかった。\n学校生活とグループでの完全な使い分けをしていたのだ。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seV