1750.jpeg","id":"5920B4F6-7427-4A04-B1BF-32EAAFDE54CC","slideTitle":"中扉"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"僕たちがそれから、数十分ほど待っていると、フランが部屋の扉を再び開き、戻ってきた。そして、あることを告げる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1751","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1751.jpeg","id":"7FA89455-94C3-4E8C-810C-BDC20CD8E337","slideTitle":"第1751スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「今、お姉様が、こいしさんの両親と協議して、一時的に私たちたちの家で、こいしさんを預かることにしたって連絡が来た。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1752","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1752.jpeg","id":"2F3F4B43-3FA4-4C0A-A9D3-74C3064D1F0E","slideTitle":"第1752スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"「それで、彼女の両親はなんと言ってましたか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1753","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1753.jpeg","id":"01705C2D-BEAD-4579-B202-9AB75B2736C0","slideTitle":"第1753スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「今、地下底国グループで派閥争いが起きていて、とてもじゃないけど彼女を家に帰らせるわけにはいかないって。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1754","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1754.jpeg","id":"F7196A81-0C96-4C71-9A04-CE09F22A1944","slideTitle":"第1754スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「それと、こないだの突如の発表は、一旦無効にして、状況が落ち着くまで、私やお姉様と協力するって言ってた。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1755","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1755.jpeg","id":"B83567F6-8C17-4FD5-9FAD-DD8BA1AB5D91","slideTitle":"第1755スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"「そうですか…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1756","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1756.jpeg","id":"D6C5757E-D198-4C41-8668-DD99E11BDD8E","slideTitle":"第1756スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"「とりあえず、空港に戻って、私たちの家に帰る、それでいい？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1757","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1757.jpeg","id":"5EFD2579-9F07-4AC8-86ED-0C0904EACD9C","slideTitle":"第1757スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「あの私は…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1758","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1758.jpeg","id":"4887CDB5-1BD6-4021-845C-11EB79871701","slideTitle":"第1758スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"「アリスさんは、自由行動で構いませんよ。ただ、もし、もう少し滞在するなら、少しばかし手続きが必要ですが…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1759","animationName":"なし","duration":5.300000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1759.jpeg","id":"BC6AD7A2-C8D0-4840-A0EA-7E7D6972027B","slideTitle":"第1759スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/アリス（困り）.png","telop":"「じゃあ、私も家に帰ろうかしら…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"アリス・マーガトロイド","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1760","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1760.jpeg","id":"6EE5B28E-320F-4E28-88DF-0A952A0BF838","slideTitle":"第1760スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"「こいしさんは、それで大丈夫ですか？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1761","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1761.jpeg","id":"79697FB2-3F35-4982-88B3-4FFD708AA118","slideTitle":"第1761スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"「それでいいよ…、もう一度危険な目には遭いたくないし…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1762","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1762.jpeg","id":"02B82BD6-AB24-4833-A5F3-024875C65123","slideTitle":"第1762スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/影あり困り.png","telop":"僕は、二人の意見を把握すると、そのままフランが先導する形で、フランたちの家に帰っていくのだった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1763","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1763.jpeg","id":"6CEB00DC-140E-4F97-90B0-4A1170E0A08C","slideTitle":"第1763スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（困る）.png","telop":"あれから、僕たちは家に帰り、レミリアとフランにいろいろと説明をしていると、あっという間に時間が過ぎ、夕飯時になった。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1764","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1764.jpeg","id":"D044772C-05E2-4DE0-A8B5-84C03C86654C","slideTitle":"第1764スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","telop":"そして、今はレミリアとフランになぜか説教されていた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1765","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1765.jpeg","id":"F691ECC9-4E8A-4157-9CF2-4D13277AAF06","slideTitle":"第1765スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/レミリア（不満）.png","telop":"「まったく、留守電を残していたとはいえ、\n何で私たちに相談もせずに、勝手に行動をするのよ。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1766","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1766.jpeg","id":"7FC9829E-6D78-403B-B0D0-6CB477345895","slideTitle":"第1766スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/フラン（怒る）.png","telop":"「次こう言うことがあったら、お仕置きだからね。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1767","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1767.jpeg","id":"BA0D4C8D-F351-4950-AEF3-2EB17F7FE2C8","slideTitle":"第1767スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第25話\/レミリア（困り）.png","telop":"「まぁ、今更言ったって、過ぎたことは仕方ないし、今日はこれくらいにしておくわ。今は、彼女の身の安全が優先だからね。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1768","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","backgroundName":"nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1768.jpeg","id":"80E61548-A014-48D9-B9E0-B555D9122E80","slideTitle":"第1768スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第11話\/nc196982_食堂(夜2).png","telop":"彼女はそう言うと、困った様子を浮かべるこいしを向く。\nそして、そこで会話が途切れ、沈黙の時間が流れた。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1769","animationName":"なし","duration":5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1769.jpeg","id":"D1C23453-72B1-4D88-9F80-00A21A997DD3","slideTitle":"第1769スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"僕たちは夕飯を食べ終えると、歯を磨き、\nこいしとともに元々フランと僕の二人部屋だった部屋に来た。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1770","animationName":"なし","duration":4.7,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1770.jpeg","id":"B6D82294-C451-4E85-B33C-D005C28F3F8C","slideTitle":"第1770スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"「何だか…ごめんなさい…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1771","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/2026-10-26_19-50.png","backgroundName":"2026-10-26_19-50.png","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1771.jpeg","id":"1E9381D2-936A-46C6-8AB4-BE1AE9E7F4F8","slideTitle":"第1771スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし怒り.png","telop":"「こいしさんが謝る必要はないですよ。\n僕とフランさんたちとの問題なので…。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1772","animation