Studio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし泣き怒り.png","telop":"僕が、二人部屋にやってくると、部屋の隅でこいしが泣いていた。「どうしたんですか、こいしさん…？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1994","animationName":"なし","duration":4.800000000000001,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1994.jpeg","id":"51B42EC6-731D-421A-B374-B68ACD7EA4DC","slideTitle":"第1994スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第22話\/こいし（驚く）.png","telop":"「こいしだけでいい、あとタメ口で構わないから。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"古明地こいし","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1995","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/総集編\/nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","backgroundName":"nc283171_商店街（夕方）.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.1995.jpeg","id":"F44DFC5F-3AF7-4932-AFCA-CF14F0FCCC7F","slideTitle":"第1995スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第28話\/帽子なし泣き怒り.png","telop":"「分かった…、こいし…。」\n僕はそう言い、彼女の頭をそっと撫でる。","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 1996","animationName":"なし","durat