（微笑）.png","telop":"「あら、当の本人がやってきたのね…、それで何の用かしら？」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2025","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.2025.jpeg","id":"0814FC48-48A0-4170-BFA5-39C2D8910480","slideTitle":"第2025スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/こいし（困る）.png","telop":"「えっと…、彼女について来てと言われて来ただけですけど…」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"操夢","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2026","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第15話\/D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","backgroundName":"D94F8ECB-7B4B-53CA-BC9F-CDA4A5BD0BFE.jpg","showTelopOverlay":false,"bgmVolume":0.65,"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7\/交換夫婦（総集編）_84dcf932f7.2026.jpeg","id":"49E3810A-18F1-40B2-A283-50ED15D04C22","slideTitle":"第2026スライド"},{"characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/元女子校の日常　第12話\/パチュリー（微笑）.png","telop":"「そうね…、とりあえず、私のとこに来なさい。」","seStartTimeOffset":0,"seVolume":1,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"transitionName":"なし","voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"characterName":"パチュリー・ノーレッジ","bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"title":"シーン 2027","anim